- 嘿，哟。

02:50.267 --> 02:54.100
- Keeping it cooler
than a sea cucumber is Ronnie.
- 保持凉爽
比海参还罗尼。

02:54.100 --> 02:56.067
- Hey, hey, yo.
- 嘿，嘿，哟。

02:58.100 --> 03:00.333
